abstract: "Code and reproduction materials for evaluation of learned measurement proxies: the NHANES acquisition and numerical workflow, saved aggregate and figure reconstruction, and a minimal liver-safety fixed-prediction replay collection with source-specific conditions. Complete historical liver-model training is outside the validated scope."
